WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.432 --> 00:00:17.097
Brad: Is everything Tina?

2
00:00:17.417 --> 00:00:19.617
Tina: Everything's fine.

3
00:00:20.258 --> 00:00:21.538
I made it, no problem.

4
00:00:22.178 --> 00:00:23.078
Where are the batteries?

5
00:00:23.098 --> 00:00:25.419
Bello: They are in a flashlight.

6
00:00:25.439 --> 00:00:27.880
Danny: The paper clip is up there too.

7
00:00:37.848 --> 00:00:42.550
Tina: Okay, now where will I find the paper clip that Brad and Danny shrank?

8
00:00:45.091 --> 00:00:46.852
Tina: Here it is.

9
00:00:52.654 --> 00:00:53.575
I've got them.

10
00:00:53.595 --> 00:00:55.356
Bello: Good work.

11
00:00:55.616 --> 00:00:57.116
Danny: Way to go, Tina!

12
00:00:57.176 --> 00:01:01.738
Chuck: Now she needs to get down.

13
00:01:01.758 --> 00:01:03.819
Brad: How is she going to do that?

14
00:01:03.839 --> 00:01:05.520
Tina: Just a minute.

15
00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:07.701
Dave: Where'd she go?

16
00:01:11.763 --> 00:01:13.063
Watch out below!

17
00:01:15.025 --> 00:01:18.386
Danny: You could have warned us, Tina!

18
00:01:18.406 --> 00:01:20.407
Tina: I said, "Watch out."

19
00:01:21.008 --> 00:01:22.389
Okay, I'm coming down now.

20
00:01:22.409 --> 00:01:25.070
Bello: How are you going to do that?

21
00:01:25.090 --> 00:01:27.171
Tina: I'm going to jump.

22
00:01:36.008 --> 00:01:38.029
Chuck: Wow, that was a big jump.

23
00:01:38.049 --> 00:01:40.270
Dave: That was amazing!

24
00:01:40.891 --> 00:01:42.071
Danny: That's Tina!

25
00:01:42.091 --> 00:01:45.073
Tina: Here's the paper clip.

26
00:01:45.093 --> 00:01:46.134
Brad: Thanks.

27
00:01:47.034 --> 00:01:48.255
Okay, now the batteries.

28
00:01:48.275 --> 00:01:50.036
Tina: Just a second.

29
00:01:50.056 --> 00:01:53.177
Brad: Thanks.

30
00:01:56.879 --> 00:01:58.500
Brad: There, it's fixed.

31
00:01:58.520 --> 00:02:01.382
Chuck: Do you think it will work properly this time?

32
00:02:01.402 --> 00:02:05.364
Tina: Yeah, that little shrink-gun has caused a lot of trouble.

33
00:02:06.148 --> 00:02:07.329
Brad: I'm sure it will work.

34
00:02:08.549 --> 00:02:09.730
Danny: Hey, wait a minute.

35
00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:15.212
Danny: Brad, you said that you needed these two guys for something [n3@before you could make us big

36
00:02:15.272 --> 00:02:17.973
again. Danny: Aren't you going to do anything with them?

37
00:02:18.554 --> 00:02:20.915
Dave: What do you mean, "do something" with us?

38
00:02:21.815 --> 00:02:23.136
Brad: Don't worry.

39
00:02:23.916 --> 00:02:26.377
I just said that so that you would help me find them.

40
00:02:26.397 --> 00:02:28.398
Brad: I didn't know what else to do.

41
00:02:28.418 --> 00:02:30.339
Bello: You know what, Danny?

42
00:02:31.239 --> 00:02:32.400
We did need their help.

43
00:02:33.280 --> 00:02:36.062
Bello: These two rescued you and Brad from the spider web.

44
00:02:36.082 --> 00:02:39.844
Tina: And they are the ones who helped us escape from my neighbor.

45
00:02:39.864 --> 00:02:41.785
Danny: I guess you're right.

46
00:02:41.805 --> 00:02:48.829
Danny: Without all of us working together, we wouldn't be here now─[n3@and the shrink-gun wouldn't be fixed.

47
00:02:49.550 --> 00:02:53.272
Chuck: Speaking of the shrink-gun, I think it's time to try it.

48
00:03:02.924 --> 00:03:05.185
Danny: I think you're right.

49
00:03:05.705 --> 00:03:06.725
Let's give it a try.

50
00:03:06.745 --> 00:03:08.245
Brad: Okay, Danny.

51
00:03:08.506 --> 00:03:09.746
You go stand over there.

52
00:03:09.766 --> 00:03:12.607
Danny: Okay, I'm ready.

53
00:03:12.627 --> 00:03:29.671
Brad: One, two, three Brad, are you all right?

54
00:03:29.691 --> 00:03:31.232
Dave: What happened?

55
00:03:31.252 --> 00:03:32.592
Brad: Did it work?

56
00:03:33.334 --> 00:03:35.351
Everyone: Oh no!
